pages.content:
Consider the following pseudocode using semaphores for the Producer-Consumer problem with a buffer size of 3:
```default
semaphore mutex = 1;
semaphore empty = 3;
semaphore full = 0;

Producer:
 wait(empty);
 wait(mutex);
 // add item to buffer
 signal(mutex);
 signal(full);

Consumer:
 wait(full);
 wait(mutex);
 // remove item from buffer
 signal(mutex);
 signal(empty);
```
Now assume the following scenario:
- The buffer is initially empty.
- 3 producers run in parallel and all try to produce one item each.
- No consumer runs yet.

After all 3 producers have executed successfully, what will be the values of the semaphores?

